\docType{package}
\title{Transfer Learning for Semiparametric Models}
\description{
The \pkg{TransferSemi} package implements the transfer-learning estimators
used by this repository for partially linear models, sufficient dimension
reduction, and conditional average treatment effect analyses. It includes
parametric, nonparametric, and neural-network routines for combining
information across multiple sites.
}
